   "body_html": "@MooingDuck What happens when you don&#39;t call <code>free</code>? when you don&#39;t call <code>delete</code>? 1) Memory is not returned to the <code>malloc</code> pool. 2) Destructor is not called. Memory is not returned to the <code>operator new</code> pool. The compiler will not optimise out the <code>malloc</code> call, or the <code>new</code> call just because you have a memory leak."
